      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I feel like the major problem is really only with stuff like DOF and Bloom (fortunately i haven't seen anyone use DOF). Stuff like color correction and eye adaption i don't see many people having a problem (That one Persona 5 map really needs it). But i agree, an option to disable the Post-Processing stack would be nice. I'm sick of having my headset's flare problem be worsened by bloom.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
