      "mergeID": "6407c46cd506654522911e49",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently there are quite a few worlds that use the post processing stack and i'd like to suggest a way to disable it since sometimes the effects look horrible in VR and other times it'd just be nice to have the performance boost in crowded worlds. I'm think maybe a button in the main menu or options menu that disables it.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Disable post processing stack?",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5ab16fb22caf69143dde51c7",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You should instead ask the world author to fix their world. The post process stack handles more than just bloom and aberration. For example, without tone mapping HDR light can't be represented properly.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
