  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-03-20T20:31:46.551Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would love to see a feature to toggle bloom and other post-process effects off at the client side. Many VR users go through great lengths to reduce fogging/god rays and other bloom effects that are a natural result of the lenses inside VR headsets. These users do not want even more introduced to their view by bloom and other post processing effects. This could also improve performance on low-end PCs.",
